量库承载语义召回，\n冷层用 PostgreSQL 保存元数据真相。分层规则由访问频率与新鲜度共同决定，阈值可配置。", "heading": "存储分层", "chunk_id": "phase3-arch#0", "chunk_index": 0, "ingest_time": 1789732714817, "rerank_score": 0.0, "ingest_time_iso": "2026-09-18T11:58:34.817Z"}, {"score": 0.106095, "title": "分层", "doc_id": "e2e-front", "source": "work-platform", "content": "分层\n本段用于验证工作平台前端经 BFF 到躯体层的写入链路。\n热层 Redis、温层 Qdrant、冷层 PostgreSQL。", "heading": "分层", "chunk_id": "e2e-front#1", "chunk_index": 1, "ingest_time": 1789739033951, "rerank_score": 0.0, "ingest_time_iso": "2026-09-18T13:43:53.951Z"}, {"score": 0.101151, "title": "检索链路", "doc_id": "phase3-arch", "source": "manual", "content": "检索链路\n回，\n冷层用 PostgreSQL 保存元数据真相。分层规则由访问频率与新鲜度共同决定，阈值可配置。\n用户问题先查 Redis 缓存，未命中则调用嵌入服务向量化，在 Qdrant 中按租户过滤召回 TOP50，\n再经重排模型取 TOP5。重排不可用时降级为按召回分排序，检索链路不中断。", "heading": "检索链路", "chunk_id": "phase3-arch#1", "chunk_index": 1, "ingest_time": 1789732714817, "rerank_score": 0.0, "ingest_time_iso": "2026-09-18T11:58:34.817Z"}], "backend": "body-service", "degraded": false, "latency_ms": 66}, "tenant_id": "default", "compliance": {"rules": [{"rule": "grounded", "label": "回答基于检索资料", "detail": "来源 5 条 / generator=template", "passed": true}, {"rule": "annotated", "label": "来源已标注", "detail": "缺口作答时不要求来源，但必须标 degraded", "passed": true}, {"rule": "honest_degrade", "label": "降级已如实标注", "detail": "llm_template_backend", "passed": true}, {"rule": "no_fabrication", "label": "未伪造生成", "detail": "generator=none 必须附带降级原因，否则视为伪造", "passed": true}], "checks": 4, "failed": [], "passed": true}, "confidence": 1.0, "created_at": 1789814399.6673257, "latency_ms": 2, "session_id": "", "attribution": {"model": "template", "steps": ["cache"], "doc_ids": ["brain-capabilities", "e2e-front", "phase3-arch", "phase3-ingest"], "cache_hit": true, "chunk_ids": ["brain-capabilities#0", "phase3-ingest#1", "phase3-arch#0", "e2e-front#1", "phase3-arch#1"], "retrieval_backend": "body-service"}, "decision_id": "41027cf532904a8da8033c2b7ece2640", "created_at_iso": "2026-09-19T18: